<description>&lt;p&gt;BSF shot dead a Pakistani intruder in Pathankot, Punjab, stopping an infiltration attempt. Pakistan condemned a Houthi militia attack on a Riyadh financial district tower and expressed solidarity with Saudi Arabia. Pakistan will host trilateral talks on the Saudi-Houthi escalation in Yemen. India plans to deploy an additional S400 air defence system along the Pakistan border after February 2027. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9tNERPS1Fpc1RQU19kRGh3NnN0ZDRna1BqRTY4bEoyRDJkTmhjTnFMZC1CS3NBQVhIeW1tdzV0MEZRU3djakdMSlV6TGNXSmFnV3h2Qmx0Nkt1SGkwT3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNTEtyX3VHdW9ndUk5VDFCYUIzUk8xMkF2eWozLWdTTnUwUkNPWnNUVElPMXRrWlJ0bFh6bktjNXpKRFIzcmxiMUF2bVJKbjZJbVFkOG05MFRIaHE1UmoxcTZobjFFR2JUT08zVTJ3ZDd0U2ZreEJSUEY1dTFLQlQtT0RzRHFORW4xbVhoWF9jb2dSV3duWXBsY2U0cEptQVBqRHRuLTRUdW11QkUwQ2xVa0pOb3JNS0hQNUpndFhB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1iNDQ3aDV1UUFyU1BSTGNnYUhXd09nUWxvUXczOU1FNWRUcjNmdzU3bE8xb1dxSUlfaDFyNDY5TkxtcXpBZkRBSg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE8waDYxY2RoMUZqN1RvT19XN0tqTDN0ZzVKRHRERDFsZm1PTkY5Z1Z5Q3Zvb2ZfVG5CNFZLRWo3MDE2a09vZVFDdA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Deccan Chronicle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE5kZGtHdnI5TE1GSEtPQW5vYnlZY2lXckFIMkpYTGliUUE1UjR1a1BKNHZ1TFNkaGVpYlQ0emlYcllDWFNyNl9vbzFKWkFDUHBNRWd0YXhWMWV4N2dTT3NN?oc=5&quot;&